##### USERS #####
### Get all users
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users

### Get one user
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/1

### Get user that doesn't exist
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/99

---

### Update a disposable test user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Rasudl",
    "email": "jibbly@examples.com",
    "user_password": "jibdblys"
}


